<p class="about-intro">
  Welcome to <strong>Bike Bee</strong>, your premier destination for cutting-edge electric dirt bikes and off-road vehicles. Headquartered in Dinuba, California (430 W Ventura St, Dinuba, CA 93618), we are a passionate collective of riders, technicians, and electric mobility advocates dedicated to bringing exhilarating, eco-conscious riding experiences to enthusiasts nationwide.
</p>

<h2>Powering Your Off-Road Adventures</h2>
<p>
  We believe off-road recreation should deliver raw adrenaline and instantaneous power without the fumes, high maintenance, or noise pollution of traditional gas powerplants. That conviction drives everything we do at Bike Bee.
</p>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p>
  At Bike Bee, our mission is clear: to equip American riders with highest-tier, eco-friendly electric dirt bikes that refuse to compromise on power, reliability, or thrill. We specialize in the <strong>2026 Sur-Ron Light Bee X</strong>—widely recognized as the pinnacle of lightweight electric trail and dirt engineering.
</p>
<p>
  Every bike we supply is backed by direct US-based support, an unwavering commitment to rider safety, and transparent customer care from order to unboxing and beyond.
</p>

<h2>Our Values</h2>
<div class="page-grid">
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>🏍️ Performance Excellence</h3>
    <p>We only offer products that meet our strict standards for power, durability, and riding experience. Every bike is tested and verified to ensure peak performance.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>🌱 Sustainability</h3>
    <p>Electric bikes reduce carbon emissions and environmental impact. We're committed to promoting eco-friendly transportation and recreation.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>🤝 Customer First</h3>
    <p>Your satisfaction is our priority. From expert advice to after-sales support, we're here to ensure your riding experience is exceptional.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>🛠️ Expert Support</h3>
    <p>Our team consists of experienced riders and technicians who understand electric bikes inside and out. We're here to help you make informed decisions.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Why Choose Bike Bee?</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Free 7-Day USA Shipping:</strong> Fast, free delivery to all 50 states with full transit insurance.</li>
  <li><strong>100-Day Warranty:</strong> Comprehensive motor, battery, controller, and frame coverage.</li>
  <li><strong>30-Day Returns:</strong> Money-back guarantee if you're not completely satisfied.</li>
  <li><strong>USA-Based Support:</strong> Local California customer service you can trust.</li>
  <li><strong>Expert Knowledge:</strong> We're riders ourselves – we know electric dirt bikes inside and out.</li>
  <li><strong>Secure Checkout:</strong> Safe, encrypted payment processing through Shopify Payments.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Our Story</h2>
<p>
  Bike Bee was founded by a team of off-road enthusiasts who recognized the transformative potential of electric mobility. After years of riding, testing, and tuning electric dirt bikes across California trails, we decided to create a company that puts riders first.
</p>
<p>
  Today, we're proud to serve thousands of satisfied customers across the United States, helping them experience the thrill of electric off-road riding with confidence and peace of mind.
</p>

